{"parse": {"title": "4TH-08", "pageid": 6100, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-07\" title=\"4TH-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">4TH-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-09\" title=\"4TH-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">4TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9C.86.E6.A1.8C.E7.9A.84.E4.B8.A4.E4.BE.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"圆桌的两侧\">圆桌的两侧</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 圆桌的两侧</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Both Sides of the Table</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>圆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>环<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>作<span class=\"color-value\"></span>两<span class=\"color-value\"></span>半<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>段<span class=\"color-value\"></span>弧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>线<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>己<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>方<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10408</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1\"><img alt=\"at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png/600px-Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png/900px-Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png/1200px-Cg-at_weiyuanhuihuiyi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>这种事没有开紧急会议的必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>缺乏战略的，孤注一掷的“宣战”，符合神秘学家一贯的行为模式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>他们所占据的区域，不论是范围大小还是影响力都不值一提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-508210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-508210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-508210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅱ：</div><div>嗯，行政部门目前还没有正式行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-508210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-508210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-508210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅱ：</div><div>听说部门计划派出一支队伍将他们送到教管学校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>那这件事情解决了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"weiyuanhuihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"weiyuanhuihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摊开的卷宗被合上，椅子向后挪动，人们站起身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>如果下次维尔汀又带回一批新的非登记神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>——这一次的事件还会重演吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士还站在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停在门口的委员慢慢地转过身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>我不理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>加入基金会，难道是一件让人颜面扫地的事情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>签订协议的神秘学家，不仅拥有在社会上使用神秘术的权利，还将被赐予莫大的荣耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>就在十几年前，神秘学家的应聘申请书多到人事部门用一层楼都装不完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>就算是新纪元运动也无法冲击基金会在国际社会上的权威！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>而眼前这些目光短浅的神秘学家个例——甚至不值得成为一个会议的议题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>但是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>他们并不是冲着圣洛夫基金会的名号来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>他们选择跟随维尔汀，是出于自身意愿及对维尔汀个人的信服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这与我们以往招募的职员有着根本的不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅱ：</div><div>你的意思是……是否加入基金会，对他们来说根本无关紧要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>恐怕是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>但我们并不能将他们驱逐出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我们都很清楚，现在的基金会亟需新成员的加入，以构建更强大的势力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>你想表达什么，直接说吧，Z女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士重新回到座位上，打开了手头的文件夹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>今天共融院再次提交了这份《暴雨改革：增员与秩序》的修订草案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我认为现在有必要讨论是否通过这项草案，使其进入到立法辩论阶段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅱ：</div><div>这是在自寻烦恼，女士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>请看第二十一页第三节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>“由司辰招募来的外界人员，归入司辰编制内。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>“司辰提供统一的教管及控制，并对他们的后续行为负责。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>“司辰编制内人员，在遵守《基金会员工守则》前提下，对司辰的命令负责，无需直接听命于基金会。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这将给予非登记神秘学家更高的自主权，提高他们对基金会的认同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>同样，通过司辰，基金会仍然拥有调动和部署这些人士的军事权利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这一节回答了我们现在面临的难题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>换句话说，就是把他们变成基金会的十八线合作雇佣兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我认为是紧急战时的预备役。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>这行不通。放开对神秘学家的管控会带来什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>屠杀、暴政、无止尽的复仇……他们一向把历史当成排泄激情的粪坑，任由狂瞽之言在王座上肆虐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>现实已经说明了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅱ：</div><div>正是如此。更何况，这种改革在基金会上从未有过先例。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅱ：</div><div>在当下“暴雨”突发的环境下，贸然改革只会增加风——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>抱歉，我来迟了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁大步迈进会议室，将文件夹扔到桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>讨论得很热烈啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>看来大家对这个草案相当感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>希望我现在加入还不算太晚。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "4TH-08"}}